    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/6a1a74e2c1be2f6d657aa18de559f93e.poster.avif?t=1755519741\" width=160 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/6a1a74e2c1be2f6d657aa18de559f93e.webm?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/6a1a74e2c1be2f6d657aa18de559f93e.mp4?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/079aca691ad17f138bdfe9f6d655c8a9.poster.avif?t=1755519741\" width=160 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/079aca691ad17f138bdfe9f6d655c8a9.webm?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/079aca691ad17f138bdfe9f6d655c8a9.mp4?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/99058e2c4bf41042725c773e9d8717ae.poster.avif?t=1755519741\" width=160 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/99058e2c4bf41042725c773e9d8717ae.webm?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750090/extras/99058e2c4bf41042725c773e9d8717ae.mp4?t=1755519741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>First Rotate with Space\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Increase and decrease\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Combine it all</strong>\u00a0<br>change direction J,K\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Q, E\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Space, Q , E , Z and Folding  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <br> <br>Dimensional Fold: Master the Fourth DimensionAre you ready to stretch your mind and explore the impossible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dimensional Fold, you take control of a tesseract a mesmerizing 4D hypercube and twist, turn, and fold it to match each level\u2019s target configuration. This isn\u2019t just a game; it\u2019s your ticket to wrestle with higher dimensions and come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-Bending 4D Puzzles: Step beyond 3D and challenge your spatial reasoning with six core 4D folds (XY, XZ, YZ, XW, YW, ZW). Precision controls (90\u00b0, 45\u00b0, 22.5\u00b0) let you fine-tune your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls:</strong> Navigate levels with ease using simple keyboard and mouse controls, or even a gamepad. Features like Fold Preview (SHIFT) and Undo (Z) ensure you never feel stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Watch as your tesseract twists and turns in a beautifully rendered 4D space, with smooth camera controls (Mouse Wheel, SPACE for auto-rotation) to help you see every angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary Fold Operations</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 1</strong>: XY Fold (Red)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 2</strong>: XZ Fold (Green)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 3</strong>: YZ Fold (Blue)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 4</strong>: XW Fold (Yellow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 5</strong>: YW Fold (Magenta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numpad 6</strong>: ZW Fold (Cyan)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse Wheel\u00a0</strong>: Zoom in/out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse Movement\u00a0</strong>: Rotate camera view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE\u00a0</strong>: Toggle auto-rotation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Navigation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Page Up\u00a0</strong>: Next level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Page Down</strong>: Previous level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER**</strong>: Advance to next level (when target matched)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primary Fold Operations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A/Cross</strong>: XY Fold (Red)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B/Circle</strong>: XZ Fold (Green)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X/Square</strong>: YZ Fold (Blue)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y/Triangle</strong>: XW Fold (Yellow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LB/L1</strong>: YW Fold (Magenta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RB/R1</strong>: ZW Fold (Cyan)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fold Preview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold SHIFT + Face/Shoulder Button</strong>: Preview fold result before applying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Stick</strong>: Camera zoom control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Pull up to zoom out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Pull down to zoom in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Stick Click</strong>: Toggle auto-rotation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Navigation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D-pad Up</strong>: Next level (when target matched)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D-pad Down:</strong>\u00a0Previous level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select/Back</strong>: Undo last fold</p></li></ul>",
