d SHIFT + Face/Shoulder Button</strong>: Preview fold result before applying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Stick</strong>: Camera zoom control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Pull up to zoom out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Pull down to zoom in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Stick Click</strong>: Toggle auto-rotation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Navigation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D-pad Up</strong>: Next level (when target matched)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D-pad Down:</strong>\u00a0Previous level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select/Back</strong>: Undo last fold</p></li></ul>",
